    "- **Mean** = the *average age of a person*: add all ages, divide by how many.\n",
    "- **Median** = the *age of the average person*: sort everyone, pick the middle one.\n",
    "\n",
    "They answer subtly different questions, and they react differently to extreme\n",
    "values. The median ignores outliers; the mean chases them."
